      "content": "but even if i talk to someone it doesnt change the reality. the reality is i'm just stuck. i feel like there's this certain kind of peace in just stopping... like, if i just stopped fighting, the noise would finally go away. isn't there a logic to that? where it's just more rational to stop than to keep suffering through this?",
